Aberdare is conveniently located next to Sheraton Mall, Christ Church.&nbsp;This&nbsp;newly built office space offers professional&nbsp;retail and&nbsp;office spaces. Office 1 and 3 measure at 3,144 sq ft. while office 2 and 4 measure at 3,729sq. ft. There are also 2 retail spaces with a maximum of 2,020 sq. ft.

Aberdare also offers a rooftop lounge, kitchen and bathrooms &nbsp;for private event or staff. With wheelchair access, interior and exterior parking, smart security and having elevator access, this is the ideal office space.

&nbsp;

&nbsp;

Available for 6 month rental. &nbsp;

This charming complex comprises of three attached townhouses just steps away from the famous Mullins Beach on the West Coast of Barbados. This wonderful cluster of townhouses is nestled at the end of a quiet cul-de-sac which has direct access to an expansive public park maintained by the residents in the area.

Each townhouse offers 1,840 square feet of living space set over two floors, the main floor has a large open plan with living, dining and kitchen area leading through to the downstairs bedroom. The second floor has the primary bedroom which features a walk-in closet in addition to the third bedroom as well as a bonus room which can be used as a home office, additional storage or even as a nursery. All bedrooms are airconditioned and ensuite for added convenience and the upstairs bedrooms have balconies which enjoy elevated views and cool breezes.

The complex itself is well manicured and fully enclosed for added security. There is a communal pool with gazebo which can be used for entertaining by tenants. These beautiful townhouses are walking distance to Mullins Beach, popular restaurants and a 5-minute drive to Speightstown and its surrounding amenities.&nbsp;

The tenant would be responsible for all utilities.

Located in the fastest developing commercial area on the island, are two Offices in the Williams One building available for rent.&nbsp; One office is 498 sq. ft and the other is 508 sq. ft. They can be rented together or separately, with the option of having the offices combined into one.

Both offices are ready to move in at $5.00/sq. ft.

&nbsp;

Set on the beautiful west coast of Barbados, in Prospect St James, this modern styled, 4-bedroom, 4.5 bathroom stand alone, oceanfront villa offers breathtaking views of the tranquil, turquoise-blue waters of the Caribbean Sea.&nbsp; &nbsp;

Imagine is a three-storey villa that has been recently renovated with a stylish interior as well as a keyless entry that is fully equipped with security cameras and an alarm system. On the ground floor you have a lovely kitchen equipped with all amenities, laundry room that includes a washer and dryer, powder room, and a dining area to seat 6. Next to the dining area, there is a spacious living room that opens out onto the covered terrace where you’ll find a generous sized lounge area with a saltwater pool to sit out, read a book or enjoy the rays of sunshine.

On the second floor, there are 3 substantially sized bedrooms all-inclusive of their own three-piece ensuite bathrooms. The first bedroom has a queen size bed, while the second bedroom has 2 single beds. The third bedroom includes a king size bed with a stunning view of the Sea that you can indulge in from the standing glass balcony. All bedrooms have closet space located inside the rooms as well as an additional closet located in the hallway for linens.&nbsp;

The entire third floor is occupied by the voluminous master suite, which has vaulted ceilings and wall to wall glass doors that brings in the captivating natural sunlight. The master suite includes a king size bed and a flat screen TV. There is a walk-through closet that leads into the 3-piece ensuite bathroom. With a grand balcony and tasteful furnishings located off the master suite, this balcony is perfect to lounge and take pleasure in the delightful tropical sunsets.

Each room is designed in simplicity with a radiant pop of colour to complement the rich colours of the Sea. For your convenience there are air conditioners and ceilings fans in each room for those warm nights, as well as access control, and burglar bars for your safety. The entire villa is supplied with Bose Professional Audio, Lighting, keyless entry automation, along with wireless internet.

A Housekeeper 6 days/week, personal chef during winter and peak, and around the clock concierge are all included with this villa

With its ideal location, Imagine is close to all amenities such as Jordan’s supermarket, gas stations and several restaurants. On each side of Imagine, are beautiful white sandy beaches such as Batts Rock Beach, Paradise Beach and the beach at Waves Hotel and Spa.&nbsp; For just a short distance walk you can enjoy a day in the sun and a swim in the Sea.&nbsp;

The Great House is a luxurious yet warm and welcoming island home spanning two and a half acres of manicured tropical gardens with 100 metres of prime Caribbean beachfront and&nbsp;a full complement of staff&nbsp;to cater to every need.&nbsp;Its understated style and elegance borrow much from Europe and North America while retaining its original Barbadian charm.&nbsp;

On the seaside property stands the Great House with the Great Bar overlooking a large infinity pool and the Caribbean Sea. In the Great House, the Carriage House, the two cottages and Hillaby House there are twelve spacious suites for up to 30 guests. The seaside offers&nbsp;numerous possibilities for formal or informal dining, entertainment or tranquil relaxation.

Set amongst lily ponds, lawns and lovingly tended gardens, our neighbouring land side property houses a large games room, home cinema, spa room, fully equipped gym, conference room and a floodlit US Open style tennis court.

**The Great House can be booked in suite increments of 8, 10 or 12, accommodating up to 30 guests including children. Minimum stay 7 nights.

&nbsp;

Sundeck is a gorgeous private villa located on an acre plot along Westmoreland Ridge, directly next to Royal Westmoreland. There are 5 spacious ensuite bedrooms with air-conditioning, rain showers and views across the ocean and the golf course.

The master bedroom features a sea-view private patio, walk-in wardrobe, rain shower and a free-standing bath with views across Westmoreland Golf Course.

Sundeck House blends tropical immersion, sleek design, privacy, and security at this exceptional location in St. James, Barbados. A villa with exceptional views across the Caribbean Ocean. The 5 bedrooms feature four poster beds or private terraces, with white company products provided throughout. There is a well-equipped fitness room and spa area.

We are delighted to offer this sophisticated villa with sun loungers and membership at the Royal Pavilion Beach Club.

&nbsp;

&nbsp;

Discover the Exquisite Charm of Fig Tree House. Tucked away in seclusion, this hidden gem offers a harmonious balance between contemporary luxury and classic island chic.

The property boasts a grand entrance, featuring a sweeping driveway lined with majestic Royal Palms leading to a meticulously maintained 4-bedroom, 4.5-bathroom private villa with a separate 2-bedroom, 2-bathroom guest cottage. The cottage has king bedrooms each with their own Ensuite bathroom and is fully equipped with a detailed kitchen, open plan living area, WI-FI, and air conditioning.

The open plan ground floor of the main villa with high ceilings is fully air-conditioned and has two king size bedrooms both with Ensuite bathrooms - one with access to a private, furnished patio and an office, and a large entrance hall leading to the open living space and modern kitchen fitted with high spec appliances. There is ample storage and suitable for catering to large groups and kitchen staff. In addition, there is a separate housekeeper’s work area with full laundry facilities.

The hallway leads to the upper floor via an elegant staircase to two large master suites, both with air conditioning, both opening to a private furnished upper terrace with views of the gardens and beyond. There is ample walk-in storage and closet space in both and the Ensuite bathrooms are extremely well appointed with double sinks, large showers and one bathroom also having an oversized bathtub.

A large, covered veranda has fantastic views over the breath-taking private tropical gardens and sea. There is causal seating area and a large dining area, perfect for relaxation and entertaining. The open living area is tastefully decorated and offers comfortable seating and a large TV with Sonos Sound system throughout the property.

On the exterior, the lower pool deck, accessed from the main patio, has an infinity edge swimming pool - a tranquil spot, perfect for poolside refreshments and entertaining, inclusive of parasols, sun loungers and two pool side gazebos. There is a pool side bathroom complete with large shower and an outdoor pool shower.&nbsp;

Fig Tree House has a generous double car port including an outdoor charging point, as well as a storage facility.

The property is fully secure and monitored via CCTV.&nbsp;

Amenities:&nbsp;&nbsp; Full Membership at Royal Westmoreland.

&nbsp;

Radwood Beach Villa 1 is located along the shores of one of Barbados’ most secluded, serene and tranquil beaches. Situated off-road with the gated entrance being shared with the townhouse next door, this ocean front villa is far away from all noise and commotion, offering complete tranquility and privacy for guests. The layout has been carefully designed and constructed to ensure guests can enjoy the property’s location and spectacular sea views throughout the day.

The villa has three bedrooms each with luxurious ensuite bathrooms and uninterrupted views of the surrounding scenery. The master suite has its own private oceanfront terrace where guests can relax in the morning with breakfast or at night with a glass of wine at night, while gazing at the ocean. There is a well-equipped kitchen, a dining room and guests can enjoy either indoor dining or they can choose to dine alfresco on the covered terrace. The living area flows seamlessly towards the ocean through large folding glass doors which open onto the covered terrace leading to the private plunge pool.

A winding path leads through the villa’s manicured gardens towards the beautiful beach, several steps away. This secluded beach is excellent for snorkeling, showcasing a wide variety of unique sea life for guests to discover. It is also near a myriad of exquisite restaurants, supermarkets and other amenities.

&nbsp;

&nbsp;

&nbsp;

&nbsp;

