Royal Villa 1 does not offer membership at Royal Westmoreland.

Guests can access onsite restaurants and bars.&nbsp; Guests who wish to golf can play at the applicable rates and tee off times are available between 10:00 am and 11:00 am only.&nbsp;

The villa currently provides complimentary access to:

Sugar Hill Tennis (1 km)

Fairmont Royal Pavillion Beach Club (2km)&nbsp; Lounge chairs and umbrellas (Restaurant and bar available)&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;

7 Seater Suzuki Ertiga&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;

Royal Villa 1 is a modern 2 storey, coral stone home that has been superbly maintained and stylishly decorated. There is an impressive private swimming pool, sea views and complimentary access to a 7-seater vehicle. The&nbsp;&nbsp;villa comes complete with housekeeping, dedicated villa manager and 24-hr security.

Located at the end of the Royal Villas cul-de-sac, Swansway has 3 ensuite bedrooms. Upon entering the villa, guests will be led to the open plan living/dining area accented with white and tropical decor. The living space includes a flat screen TV, DVD player, I-Pod docking station and dining table seating 6 persons. Tucked nicely to the right, is the modern kitchen, equipped with microwave, coffee maker, blender, toaster, stove top, oven, and other necessary appliances. Large double doors connect the living space and private covered dining terrace with additional seating. The entire upper floor boasts views of lush gardens, private swimming pool and the enticing Caribbean Sea.

On the ground floor, guests will find the master bedroom with king size bed and bedroom 2 with twin beds; both features walk through closets and Ensuite double vanity bathrooms. The master suite includes a separate tub and shower, while bedroom 2 is fitted with a walk-in shower. Both bedrooms have access to the shared pool deck leading right out to the large private swimming pool. The remaining bedroom on the first floor is equipped with a queen size bed and includes an ensuite bathroom with walk-in shower and double vanity.

Guests must be over the age of 25 and carry a local permit to drive which costs US$5 per person. The vehicle is given clean, with a full tank of gas, and must be returned with the same.&nbsp;

All guests need to&nbsp; register online at the link below, and pay per person for a local permit.

https://portal.bra.gov.bb/VisitorPermit

Once this is completed, kindly email our concierge at&nbsp; concierge@barbadossothebysrealty.com &nbsp;prior to arrival with a copy of your license (front and back), final permits, and your recent accident/claim history.

Schooner Bay is one of the most luxurious residential beachfront condominiums on the West Coast of Barbados. Conveniently located close to the historic town of Speightstown, this exclusive gated development is nestled on the secluded Godings Bay beach in a picturesque setting, surrounded by tropical landscaped gardens.&nbsp;&nbsp;

Located on the first floor, Schooner Bay 204 is a spacious two-bedroom apartment that benefits from an abundance of natural light and enjoy direct views of the beach and turquoise waters of the Caribbean Sea.&nbsp; Stylishly decorated in cool tones with coastal accents and featuring high ceilings and limestone floors, this holiday rental strikes the perfect balance between Caribbean elegance and modern minimalist interior design.&nbsp;

A spacious entrance hall leads to the main living area which features an open plan design and flows onto a covered dining terrace where guests can relax and enjoy the panoramic ocean views and breath-taking sunsets.&nbsp; For those looking to try their hands at some Caribbean cuisine, there is a fully equipped kitchen with stainless steel appliances nestled into the corner of the living space.&nbsp; &nbsp;

Schooner Bay 204 sleeps up to four guests comfortably.&nbsp; Each bedroom is air-conditioned and features full marble en-suite bathrooms and walk-in closets.&nbsp; The Master suite has direct access to the private terrace and bedroom two has a king bed that can be converted to two twins.

A range of activities can be enjoyed while staying at Schooner Bay including spending the day soaking up the sun while lounging by the free-form swimming pool and Jacuzzi or enjoying a swim in the warm shallow waters of the Caribbean Sea. For the more adventurous a selection of water sports is also on offer.

Guests also benefit from assigned parking, 24-hour security and facilities including a fitness centre, sun loungers and umbrellas as well as the amenities in the nearby Speightstown such as shopping, restaurants, banking and more.

Policy:

No Pets allowed

Non-smoking

A stunning three-bedroom townhouse nestled in beautifully landscaped gardens, with a private plunge pool, and access to several Royal Westmoreland amenities, including an onsite gym, restaurant, tennis courts, and communal pools. Golf Buggy included in the rental.

A stunning 3 bedroom townhouse nestled in beautifully landscaped gardens, with a private plunge pool.&nbsp;Royal Villa 12 features an open plan living and dining area with large doors leading to a spacious terrace. The fully equipped kitchen includes modern appliances and each of the three bedrooms is well-appointed, with the master suite offering a private en-suite bathroom.

Guests enjoy social membership with access to Royal Westmoreland’s premium amenities, including a fully equipped gym, an onsite restaurant, tennis courts, and communal pools.&nbsp;

A Golf Buggy included in the rental.&nbsp;

A beautiful 2-bedroom, 2.5-bathroom split level duplex with living area, kitchen, guest cloakroom, pool, and a large patio on the ground floor and two bedrooms upstairs each with their own Ensuite bathrooms, one of which has an additional outdoor shower area.

In the best part of the West Coast and located in Holetown, this villa was fully renovated in 2019, including the addition of a new pool, brand new kitchen and bathrooms and landscaping. The house is furnished with luxury brands such as Roche-Bobois and everything has been designed by the owners in detail as they spend part of the time in this house. The housekeeper, who has been working with the owners for years, is included in the rent twice a week from Monday to Friday.

Limegrove 7 was originally built some 50 years ago, and Limegrove Lifestyle Center was built around the house which now includes the newly opened Clifton Market. The house benefits from the 24-hour security of Limegrove Lifestyle Center security patrols. The best refined shopping and dining area in Barbados is within easy 5-minute walking access and includes some of the renowned restaurants such as The Cliff, Lonestar and Tides.

Limegrove Villas are in a prime location in Holetown, just a short 3-minute walk to the beach and with all the essential services, such as supermarkets, pharmacists, and any amenities you could ever require at your doorstep. Also, you are in a residential compound within a private road recently repaved that provides a holiday atmosphere.&nbsp;

For those who would like a car free vacation, Limegrove 7 is ideal as it could easily take a taxi from the airport to the house and never need to get in a car again until you head back to the airport! At the same time, for those who would like to enjoy the South Coast and more variety, including events such as the Cricket World Cup, this villa is only 15 minutes’ drive to the stadium by car, taxi, or bus.

Special Notes

The housekeeper will come twice a week (half day each visit)

Excess electricity use above USD 1,000 per week (as per meter readings) will be charged from the deposit.&nbsp;

The house is in the middle of Limegrove Lifestyle shopping and entertainment area. As such there could be more noise then would be expected in a normal residential area, particularly on weekends.

"Staycation tenants", party-tourists, groups of adults below 30 years old or children in the house below 14 years old are not permitted.&nbsp;

&nbsp;

&nbsp;

Apartment 104, situated on the ground floor is a spacious 2 bedroom apartment that has been nicely furnished and finished to an exceptional standard. Both bedrooms afford en suite bathrooms and personal closet space. The open plan living/dining and kitchen area peer out onto the sea facing dining terrace. The apartment affords sea views and includes all necessary amenities for a wonderful holiday such as high speed WIFI, cable TV, oven, stove, microwave, dishwasher, washer, dryer and more. Guests have access to the communal pool deck with complimentary lounge chairs and umbrellas, an on-site equipped which is free of charge and an underground parking garage with easy access to the apartment via an elevator.

Located in Paynes Bay on the West Coast, Waterside offers its guests an idyllic setting in a tropical paradise, with all modern amenities close at hand. The popular Holetown area is a mere 5 minutes North of the development, with its supermarkets, banks, duty-free shopping facilities and boasting some of the islands best restaurants, from the affordable to the exclusive. Water sports are available within a few minutes' walk and several world class golf courses are just a short drive away. The world famous 'The Cliff' restaurant is a short walk away, while Daphne's restaurant is even closer. The Sandy Lane Hotel is a comfortable stroll up the beach.

The development is set back from the main road, ensuring peace and privacy while on vacation.&nbsp;

&nbsp;

&nbsp;

Summerland 201 enjoys a ground-floor location in the tranquil Summerland development on Barbados' Platinum Coast. Summerland is a gated development featuring two buildings each with six apartments as well as a communal pool with gazebo and beach access.

Summerland 201 includes 3 bedrooms, the master includes an en suite while the two guest bedrooms share a bathroom.&nbsp; This open plan unit features spacious living areas, an extended private patio and a fully-equipped kitchen. The living areas open out to the expansive patio which is not communal space and therefore not for use by the guests of other units, but is strictly reserved for the enjoyment of the occupants of Unit 201 and provides direct access to the communal pool deck.&nbsp;

Summerland enjoys a premier location opposite the famous Prospect Beach and is within walking distance of supermarkets and restaurants. Located nearby is the popular town of Holetown offering fine dining, Limegrove Lifestyle Center and nightlife, as well as Barbados' capital Bridgetown.

&nbsp;
